    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Oublivious</i></strong><i> </i>is a fast-paced time-chaser combat platformer set in a medieval dungeon where you play as a desperate thief seeking treasure to achieve the fame and fortune you've always desired, however, you must avoid traps and defeat enemies guarding this treasure. The game blends first-person action platforming with subtle RPG elements, offering a thrilling, momentum-based experience.</p>",
